- **viewing order** - 3/3 episodes whose heading states an order are reproduced by the recording timestamps; order for all 36 episodes is therefore taken from timestamps.
- **gaze rebuilt** - Deviation from centre restored to a FIXED FORWARD reference in degrees, per the published definition (1 - X, i.e. 1 - cos theta, against the device axis) rather than each file's own median. Axis is per round: Round 1 Unreal (X forward, Y horizontal, Z vertical), Round 2 Unity (Z forward, X horizontal, Y vertical). EYE-IN-HEAD only; head pose is deferred by author ruling 2026-07-31.
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness, gaze deviation from centre; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness, gaze deviation from centre; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **keystone composite** - engaged composite = mean within-subject z of pupil dilation, eye openness, gaze deviation from centre; gaze-deviation variance excluded because it is rate-dependent and the composite spans both rounds
- **window comparison** - Round 2 analysed at both the full crop and a Round-1-matched window dropping 120 s from each end, mirroring the ~2 min sync guards Round 1 cut inside its instructed closures.
- **EEG** - Every cell is reported regardless of retention. No cell is excluded for being noisy, because the retention and SNR figures ARE the evidence for the ruling that EEG was dropped as too noisy; removing the worst cells would remove the justification.

